<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02_吸收、理解、欺骗蒙蔽与留宿 (Absorption, Comprehension & Deception — '吃透/骗进')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 12 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>drink <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>吸收</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>drink, steep</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be fascinated or spell-bound by; pay close attention to<div class='ex-sent'>“The mother drinks in every word of her son on the stage”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>draw <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 1/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>引诱，紧缩开支</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>attract, pull</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> direct toward itself or oneself by means of some psychological power or physical attributes<div class='ex-sent'>“Her good looks attract the stares of many men”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>draw <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 3/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>引诱</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>hollow, draw</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> draw in as if by suction<div class='ex-sent'>“suck in your cheeks and stomach”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>draw <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 4/6</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>到达，抵达，火车</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>arrive, trains</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> of trains; move into (a station)<div class='ex-sent'>“The bullet train drew into Tokyo Station”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>draw <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 5/6</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>前进，进展，提高</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>advance, progress</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> advance or converge on<div class='ex-sent'>“The police were closing in on him”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>draw <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 6/6</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>收缩，紧缩开支</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>curl, bend</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> shape one's body into a curl<div class='ex-sent'>“She curled farther down under the covers”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>suck <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>吸收</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>consume, ingest</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take up as if with a sponge<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to suck in (take up as if with a sponge).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>suck <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>吸收</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>hollow, draw</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> draw in as if by suction<div class='ex-sent'>“suck in your cheeks and stomach”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>suck <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 3/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>吸收</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>suck, absorb</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> attract by using an inexorable force, inducement, etc.<div class='ex-sent'>“The current boom in the economy sucked many workers in from abroad”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>sink <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>渗入，透入</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>percolate, permeate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> pass through<div class='ex-sent'>“Water permeates sand easily”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>rope <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'><非正>说服，拉拢</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>persuade, draw</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> draw in as if with a rope; lure<div class='ex-sent'>“The agent had roped in several customers”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>rope <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>围绕，圈起，放入封套</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>enclose, inclose</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> divide by means of a rope<div class='ex-sent'>“The police roped off the area where the crime occurred”</div></td></tr>
