<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03_参与、插嘴、干预、凑份与替补 (Participation, Intervention & Contribution — '卷入/插手')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 26 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 1/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>召集，召来</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>summon</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> summon to a particular activity or employment<div class='ex-sent'>“Experts were called in”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 3/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>打电话，打电话给，包围</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>telephone, phone</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> make a phone call<div class='ex-sent'>“call in to a radio station”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 4/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>移动，调动，除去</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>remove, game</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take a player out of a game in order to exchange for another player<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to call in (take a player out of a game in order to exchange for another player).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 5/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>来访</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>visit, meet</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> pay a brief visit<div class='ex-sent'>“The mayor likes to call on some of the prominent citizens”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 6/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>召集，召来，来访</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>recall, withdraw</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to be returned<div class='ex-sent'>“recall the defective auto tires”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 7/7</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>要求，查询，强求</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>demand, exact</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> demand payment of (a loan)<div class='ex-sent'>“Call a loan”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>break <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 2/4</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>闯入，打断</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>interrupt, disrupt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> break into a conversation<div class='ex-sent'>“her husband always chimes in, even when he is not involved in the conversation”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>cut <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 1/4</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>切断，切下，路堑</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cutting</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> mix in with cutting motions<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to cut in (mix in with cutting motions).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>cut <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 2/4</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>插嘴，插入，把...插进</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>interrupt, disrupt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> interrupt a dancing couple in order to take one of them as one's own partner<div class='ex-sent'>“Jim always cuts in!”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>cut <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 3/4</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>把...插进</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>pull, drive</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> drive in front of another vehicle leaving too little space for that vehicle to maneuver comfortably<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to cut in (drive in front of another vehicle leaving too little space for that vehicle to maneuver comfortably).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>cut <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 4/4</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>把...插进</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>partake, share</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> allow someone to have a share or profit<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to cut in (allow someone to have a share or profit).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>代演员站位</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>substitute, sub</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be a substitute<div class='ex-sent'>“The young teacher had to substitute for the sick colleague”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>break <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 4/4</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使经使用逐渐合用，闯入</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>intrude, irrupt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> intrude on uninvited<div class='ex-sent'>“The nosy couple broke in on our conversation”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>drop <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>顺便走访</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>visit</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> visit informally and spontaneously<div class='ex-sent'>“We frequently drop by the neighbors' house for a cup of coffee”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>sit <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>参加静坐罢工</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>disobey, participate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> participate in an act of civil disobedience<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to sit in (participate in an act of civil disobedience).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>sit <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>代人暂时照料，参加静坐罢工</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>attend</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> attend as a visitor<div class='ex-sent'>“Can I sit in on your Intermediate Hittite class?”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>kick <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>踢坏</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>destroy, ruin</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> open violently<div class='ex-sent'>“kick in the doors”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>kick <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>有助于，捐助，投稿</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>contribute, cause</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> contribute to some cause<div class='ex-sent'>“I gave at the office”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>pitch <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>吃，腐蚀，衷心地</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>eat</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> eat heartily<div class='ex-sent'>“The food was placed on the table and the children pitched in”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>chip <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>捐助</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>contribute, cause</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> contribute to some cause<div class='ex-sent'>“I gave at the office”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>butt <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>插手</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>interrupt, disrupt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> break into a conversation<div class='ex-sent'>“her husband always chimes in, even when he is not involved in the conversation”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>burst <span class='pt-highlight'>in on</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>阻碍某人</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>interrupt, disrupt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> spring suddenly<div class='ex-sent'>“He burst upon our conversation”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>horn <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>闯入</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>intrude, pry</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> search or inquire in a meddlesome way<div class='ex-sent'>“This guy is always nosing around the office”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>barge <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>闯入</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>interrupt, disrupt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> break into a conversation<div class='ex-sent'>“her husband always chimes in, even when he is not involved in the conversation”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>partake <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>参与，参加，分享</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>participate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be active in<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to partake in (be active in).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>chime <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>插话</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>interrupt, disrupt</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> break into a conversation<div class='ex-sent'>“her husband always chimes in, even when he is not involved in the conversation”</div></td></tr>
