<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04_坍塌、屈服让步、迎合与开启生效 (Collapse, Capitulation & Activation — '向内塌/妥协')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 22 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>give <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (Inseparable)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>屈服，让步，妥协</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>yield, succumb</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> yield to another's wish or opinion<div class='ex-sent'>“The government bowed to the military pressure”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>in motion</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>把...发动起来</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>launch, displace</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> get going; give impetus to<div class='ex-sent'>“launch a career”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>fall <span class='pt-highlight'>in love</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>陷入爱河，追爱总动员</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>begin</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> begin to experience feelings of love towards<div class='ex-sent'>“She fell in love with her former student”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>keep <span class='pt-highlight'>in line</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>操纵，利用，操作</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>manipulate, control</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> control (others or oneself) or influence skillfully, usually to one's advantage<div class='ex-sent'>“She manipulates her boss”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>变成，变得，a. 建立的</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>become</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> become established<div class='ex-sent'>“winter has set in”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 3/3</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>开始，上涨</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>blow, shore</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> blow toward the shore<div class='ex-sent'>“That gale could set in on us with the next high tide”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>stay <span class='pt-highlight'>in place</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>制止，延缓，坚持</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>stay</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be stationary<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to stay in place (be stationary).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>fall <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>倒塌</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>collapse, break</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> break down, literally or metaphorically<div class='ex-sent'>“The wall collapsed”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>hold <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>抑制</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>control, contain</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> lessen the intensity of; temper; hold in restraint; hold or keep within limits<div class='ex-sent'>“moderate your alcohol intake”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>fall <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>放置，寄予，认出</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>place</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> to take one's place in a military formation or line<div class='ex-sent'>“Troops fall in!”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>trade <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>折价换取，经营，做买卖</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>trade, exchange</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> turn in as payment or part payment for a purchase<div class='ex-sent'>“trade in an old car for a new one”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>hold <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 3/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>隐藏，掩盖，隐瞒</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>conceal, back</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> hold back; keep from being perceived by others<div class='ex-sent'>“She conceals her anger well”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>fall <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 3/3</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>集合</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>join, become</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> become part of; become a member of a group or organization<div class='ex-sent'>“He joined the Communist Party as a young man”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>fall <span class='pt-highlight'>in line</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>排队</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>align, array</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> agree on (a position)<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to fall in line (agree on (a position)).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>cash <span class='pt-highlight'>in on</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>靠...赚钱，乘机利用</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>profit, gain</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take advantage of or capitalize on<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to cash in on (take advantage of or capitalize on).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>cash <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>兑现</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cash, exchange</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> exchange for cash<div class='ex-sent'>“I cashed the check as soon as it arrived in the mail”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>phase <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>逐步采用，分阶段引入</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>introduce, innovate</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> introduce gradually<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to phase in (introduce gradually).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>cave <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>塌落，下陷</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>collapse, break</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> break down, literally or metaphorically<div class='ex-sent'>“The wall collapsed”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>usher <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>迎接...，开创...</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>inaugurate, introduce</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be a precursor of<div class='ex-sent'>“The fall of the Berlin Wall ushered in the post-Cold War period”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>rein <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>放慢，止住，控制</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>rein, stop</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> stop or slow up one's horse or oneself by or as if by pulling the reins<div class='ex-sent'>“They reined in in front of the post office”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>rake <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>迅速大量取得</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>gain, clear</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> earn large sums of money<div class='ex-sent'>“Since she accepted the new position, she has been raking it in”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>rein <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>控制</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>harness, rein</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> control and direct with or as if by reins<div class='ex-sent'>“rein a horse”</div></td></tr>
